    "body": "> Why not have a single keyword and make the type depend on the return type? `async_` seems rather redundant with `Promise`.\n\nI'm neutral either way. I just want to be able to do stuff like `using {signal} = new AbortController()`, so anything that accomplishes that goal (and isn't horribly inefficient) is good by me. 🙂",
